### 1. List all books — 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 2. Filter + limit — 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### 3. Existing book — 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 4. Missing book — 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 5. Create — 201 + Location
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pro Spring 6",
  "author": "Cosmina",
  "year": 2023
}

### 6. Replace — 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java, 3rd Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}

### 7. Delete — 204, then repeat for 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### 8. Variant 1 — title fragment search — 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?title=java

### 9. Variant 1 empty result — 200 []
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?title=zzzzzz

### ERROR 400 — id cannot be converted to long
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/abc

### ERROR 404 — no mapping
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### ERROR 405 — /api/books exists but DELETE is not mapped there
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books

### ERROR 415 — controller expects JSON body
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

not-json

### ERROR 406 — JSON available, XML representation is not configured
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/xml

### MVC PRG test — 302 then GET /books
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java%20Precisely&author=Sestoft&year=2016
